  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4f6e8993ed68f1c47b5bcfa27204605d, type: 3}
  m_Name: Start
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSystem.DialogueData
  lines:
  - Hey! You okay?
  - ...
  - You look a little lost.
  - Do you even know where you are?
  - ...
  - No?
  - Yeah...
  - That makes sense.
  - This forest tends to do that.
  - People wander in... and then things get a little...
  - <color=#AAAAAA><size=85%><i>weird.</i></size></color>
  - Anyway!
  - 'If you want to get out of here, just head to the right. '
  - Use WASD or Joystick to walk.
  - Press Space or South Button to Jump.
  - I'll guide you, don't worry.
